## 2. Write a function that returns the sum of all the elements in an array.

### Solution

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

int sumArray(int* array, int size) {
    int sum = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) {
        sum += array[i];
    }
    return sum;
}

int main() {
    int array[] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
    int sum = sumArray(array, sizeof(array) / sizeof(int));
    printf("Sum of array is %d\n", sum);
    return 0;
}
```

### Output

```
Sum of array is 15
```

